          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nedumunye olkitok lenye tadekenya; ore ake pee ebol kutuk aji e ina aji neipang alo, ng'ura, eirragita enkapiani enye te kutuk aji e ina aji, eibung'ita too nkaik enyena ntaloishin e kutukaji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ninye, “Tudumunye maape.” Kake eitu ewalikini ninye. Nepik ilo tung'ani ninye enkoriong o sikiria lenye; nedumunye ilo lee nelo enkang enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.11.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 11.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore ake pee ejing ninye enkaji enye, neyau enkalem, neibung ina apiani enye neorrior ninye erubata o erubata aitaa irubat tomon o are, neirriwaa ninye nkuapi pooki e Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pooki ootoduaa ina nejo, “Eitu ae kata easayu embae neeijo ena aashu edoli ebaiki enkolong apa naileputua iltung'ana le Israel aapuku te nkop e Misiri o metabaiki ena olong; embirribirra enguanare niwaliwala.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.30"
            ]
          }
        }
